    "code": "\"% margin_01 — classical stability margins of L(s) = 1.8 / (s^3 + 3s^2 + 2s)\\nnum = [1.8];\\nden = [1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 0.0];   % type-1 loop (integrator included)\\nL = tf(num, den);\\n\\n% margin(L) returns [Gm, Pm, Wcg, Wcp] — assign in this exact order:\\n%   3rd output Wcg -> w_gc (gain crossover), 4th output Wcp -> w_pc (phase crossover)\\n[Gm, Pm, Wcg, Wcp] = margin(L);\\n\\ngm_db  = 20 * log10(Gm);   % linear gain margin -> dB\\npm_deg = Pm;               % phase margin, already in degrees\\nw_gc   = Wcg;\\nw_pc   = Wcp;\\n\\nr = struct('gm_db', gm_db, 'pm_deg', pm_deg, 'w_gc', w_gc, 'w_pc', w_pc);\\nfid = fopen('result.json', 'w');\\nfwrite(fid, jsonencode(r));\\nfclose(fid);\"",
